## Installation

{% if micropython_pkg %}This is MicroPython firmware — there is nothing to pip-install.
Connect a device and deploy with `mpremote` (see the README).
{% elif oj_code %}This is an online-judge workspace: it ships no importable package, so there
is nothing to install. Sync the project environment (see the README) and start
from `main.py`.
{% else %}```console
$ pip install {{ distribution_name }}
```
{% endif %}

## Usage

{% if micropython_pkg %}```python
from firmware.core.app import BlinkConfig, run
```
{% elif oj_code %}Each solution lives in its own `main.py`, tested and submitted with your
judge's tooling; there is no package to import (see the README).
{% else %}```python
from {{ import_pkg }} import __version__

print(f"Hello {{ import_pkg }} {__version__}")
```
{% endif -%}
